      <title><![CDATA[Bank of Baroda raises another $400 million overseas, takes 2031 bond issue to $700 million]]></title>
      <link><![CDATA[https://www.cnbctv18.com/business/companies/bank-of-baroda-raises-another-400-million-overseas-takes-2031-bond-issue-to-700-million-19974732.htm]]></link>
      <description><![CDATA[Bank of Baroda has raised an additional $400 million through five-year senior unsecured notes carrying a 5.318% coupon, adding to the $300 million issued earlier.]]></description>
