      <title><![CDATA[Caplin Point arm gets 10 USFDA observations after unannounced inspection; no data integrity issues]]></title>
      <link><![CDATA[https://www.cnbctv18.com/business/companies/caplin-point-arm-gets-10-usfda-observations-after-unannounced-inspection-no-data-integrity-issues-19974709.htm]]></link>
      <description><![CDATA[The USFDA issued 10 observations after inspecting Caplin Steriles’ Gummidipoondi facility. The company said they are procedural in nature, with none related to data integrity or repeated from earlier inspections.]]></description>
